{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24258","headline":"送姚杭州赴任因思旧游二首 二 · 白居易","name":"送姚杭州赴任因思旧游二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺钱唐路几千，想君到後事依然。\n静逢竺寺猨偷橘，闲看苏家女采莲。\n故妓数人凭问询，新诗两首倩留传。\n舍人虽健无多兴，老挍当时八九年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}